  <name>MultiFlexi Event Processor</name>
  <summary>Event-driven job triggering for MultiFlexi</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      MultiFlexi Event Processor polls webhook adapter databases for cached change events, matches them against configurable rules, and schedules MultiFlexi jobs accordingly. It provides event-driven job triggering as a complement to the time-based scheduling offered by MultiFlexi Scheduler, enabling reactive workflows in the MultiFlexi platform.
    </p>
  </description>
